## Event Handler Naming

```tsx
// ✅ Correct — handle<Event>
const handleSubmit = (e: React.FormEvent) => { ... };
const handleClick = () => { ... };
const handleInputChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => { ... };

// ❌ Wrong
const submitForm = () => { ... };
const clickButton = () => { ... };
```

---

## Naming Convention

| Type | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Component file | PascalCase | `UserCard.tsx`, `LoginForm.tsx` |
| Custom hook | `use` + PascalCase | `useAuth.ts`, `useUsers.ts` |
| Event handler | `handle` + Event | `handleSubmit`, `handleClick` |
| Props interface | Component + `Props` | `UserCardProps`, `LoginFormProps` |
| Context | Domain + `Context` | `AuthContext`, `CartContext` |
